WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A recording can help you begin. But what, exactly, helped?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
In one randomized study, hypnosis and relaxation recordings both improved reported pain.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Neither proved that a commercial meditation file transforms attention.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Zen12 lists a twelve-level library. The convenience is real as a format; promised results still need evidence.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try twelve quiet minutes for free. Then decide what a library is worth to you.
